#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
monitor_indian_land.py

Polls Indian Land Warriors (Fort Mill, SC) team pages on MaxPreps and alerts
you when something changes: record, rank, next game, a new result posted,
or standings movement. Produces a single ESPN-style HTML dashboard with a
tab per sport.

Sports watched:
  - Football
  - Basketball
  - Soccer                (spring)
  - Volleyball (Girls)
  - Volleyball (Boys)     (fall)
  - Baseball
  - Softball

For each sport, four pages are watched:
  - Team home        (overall/region record, rank)
  - Schedule          (games, results, next game)
  - Standings         (region + class standings)
  - Stats              (team leaders / star players)

Usage:
  python monitor_indian_land.py                # run forever, poll every 30 min
  python monitor_indian_land.py --once         # single check, print report, exit
  python monitor_indian_land.py --interval 15  # poll every 15 minutes
  python monitor_indian_land.py --state my.json --log my.log

Requires:
  pip install requests beautifulsoup4 lxml
"""

